{"seq":1,"slug":"social-network-analysis","title":"社会网络分析（Social Network Analysis）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications/social-network-analysis","wordCount":1809,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"社会网络分析-social-network-analysis\">社会网络分析（Social Network Analysis）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>弱连接的力量</strong>：非冗余信息通过弱连接（跨社区桥梁）而非强连接传播</li>\n<li><strong>结构洞</strong>：两个不直接连接群组之间的间隙，跨越者获得信息和控制优势（Burt 约束度量化）</li>\n<li><strong>复杂传播 vs 简单传播</strong>：行为扩散需社会确认（宽桥），信息传播一次接触即可（弱连接）</li>\n<li><strong>在线社交网络</strong>：活跃互动核心仍受 Dunbar 数限制，信息级联呈重尾分布</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"社会网络分析的学科定位\">社会网络分析的学科定位</h2><p>社会网络分析（SNA）将社会结构建模为个体（节点）之间的关系（边）构成的图，关注结构位置如何约束和赋能个体行为。SNA 不是社会学的附属方法——它是一种独立的分析范式，核心假设是：个体的行为和机会不仅取决于其属性（年龄、教育、收入），更取决于其在关系网络中的结构位置。</p>\n<p>SNA 的历史线索：Moreno (1930s) 的社会计量学 → Granovetter (1973) 的弱连接理论 → Burt (1992) 的结构洞理论 → Watts/Barabasi (1998-99) 引入网络科学工具 → 2000s 在线社交平台提供大规模数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"强连接与弱连接\">强连接与弱连接</h2><p>Granovetter 的&quot;弱连接的力量&quot;（1973）是 SNA 最著名的理论。核心论点：你获得新工作/新信息的渠道更可能来自弱连接（不常联系的熟人）而非强连接（亲密朋友）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>连接类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>信息功能</th>\n<th>网络位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强连接</td>\n<td>高频互动、情感亲密、互惠</td>\n<td>信任、支持、冗余信息</td>\n<td>社区内部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱连接</td>\n<td>低频互动、低情感投入</td>\n<td>桥接不同社区、非冗余信息</td>\n<td>跨社区桥梁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>潜在连接</td>\n<td>存在路径但无直接互动</td>\n<td>通过中介可达</td>\n<td>二阶/三阶邻居</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>机制解释：强连接嵌入在紧密的局部群组中——你的亲密朋友彼此也认识（传递性高）。因此他们获得的信息高度重叠。弱连接则连接到不同的社会圈子，带来非冗余信息。</p>\n<p>网络科学的量化验证：定义边的&quot;重叠度&quot;（overlap）= 两端点共同邻居数 / 两端点全部邻居数。实证发现重叠度与边强度（交互频率）正相关——强连接确实嵌入在高度重叠的局部结构中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构洞理论\">结构洞理论</h2><p>Burt 的结构洞（structural hole）理论将 SNA 的焦点从节点属性转向节点间的&quot;空缺&quot;。结构洞是两个不直接连接的群组之间的间隙——跨越结构洞的节点（broker/桥接者）拥有信息和控制优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 群组A&#10;        A1((A1)) --- A2((A2))&#10;        A2 --- A3((A3))&#10;        A1 --- A3&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 群组B&#10;        B1((B1)) --- B2((B2))&#10;        B2 --- B3((B3))&#10;        B1 --- B3&#10;    end&#10;    A2 --- B1&#10;    A2 -.-&gt;|桥接者: 跨越结构洞| B1\">graph TD\n    subgraph 群组A\n        A1((A1)) --- A2((A2))\n        A2 --- A3((A3))\n        A1 --- A3\n    end\n    subgraph 群组B\n        B1((B1)) --- B2((B2))\n        B2 --- B3((B3))\n        B1 --- B3\n    end\n    A2 --- B1\n    A2 -.-&gt;|桥接者: 跨越结构洞| B1</pre><p>Burt 的约束度（constraint）量化节点的结构洞优势：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i = \\sum_j \\left( p_{ij} + \\sum_{q \\neq i,j} p_{iq} p_{qj} \\right)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.804em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,84c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-92c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,