mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 3600\"><path d=\"M76,0c-16.7,0,-25,3,-25,9c0,2,2,6.3,6,13c21.3,28.7,42.3,60.3,\n63,95c96.7,156.7,172.8,332.5,228.5,527.5c55.7,195,92.8,416.5,111.5,664.5\nc11.3,139.3,17,290.7,17,454c0,28,1.7,43,3.3,45l0,9\nc-3,4,-3.3,16.7,-3.3,38c0,162,-5.7,313.7,-17,455c-18.7,248,-55.8,469.3,-111.5,664\nc-55.7,194.7,-131.8,370.3,-228.5,527c-20.7,34.7,-41.7,66.3,-63,95c-2,3.3,-4,7,-6,11\nc0,7.3,5.7,11,17,11c0,0,11,0,11,0c9.3,0,14.3,-0.3,15,-1c5.3,-5.3,10.3,-11,15,-17\nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-144c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.254em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.5029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{ij} = \\frac{w_{ij}}{\\sum_k w_{ik}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3787em;vertical-align:-0.57em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8087em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1746em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3214em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5073em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.57em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系投入比例。约束度低 = 结构洞丰富 = 信息优势大。</p>\n<p>大量实证研究（横跨企业内部网络、企业间联盟、科学合作）确认：结构洞位置与晋升速度、创新产出、薪酬溢价正相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"影响力传播与扩散\">影响力传播与扩散</h2><p>社会网络上的影响力传播区分两种机制：</p>\n<p><strong>简单传播</strong>：一次接触即可&quot;感染&quot;（类比流行病）。Hub 节点是最有效的种子。网络中的&quot;意见领袖&quot;被假定具有此类一次性说服力。</p>\n<p><strong>复杂传播</strong>：需要多个独立来源的&quot;社会确认&quot;才能被影响（Centola 2010）。此时：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>聚集系数促进传播（强连接社区提供多次确认）</li>\n<li>弱连接反而可能<em>阻碍</em>传播（孤立的一次接触不够触发）</li>\n<li>宽桥（wide bridge）——跨社区的多条平行边——比窄桥更有效</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传播类型</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>网络结构效应</th>\n<th>最优种子策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单传播</td>\n<td>一次接触</td>\n<td>Hub 加速</td>\n<td>选最高度节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂传播</td>\n<td>多次确认</td>\n<td>聚集促进</td>\n<td>选紧密社区的核心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>依上下文</td>\n<td>两者都重要</td>\n<td>需仿真优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"在线社交网络的大规模实证\">在线社交网络的大规模实证</h2><p>Facebook、Twitter/X、微信等平台提供了前所未有的大规模社会网络数据。关键发现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dunbar 数的网络版</strong>：虽然在线&quot;好友&quot;可达数百上千，但活跃互动的核心关系数仍然受限于 ~150（认知容量限制）</li>\n<li><strong>同质性</strong>（homophily）：人们优先连接与自己相似的人——年龄、教育、观点。因果方向难以区分：是相似导致连接，还是连接导致相似（社会影响）？</li>\n<li><strong>信息级联</strong>：在线内容的分享模式呈重尾——大多数内容几乎不传播，极少数形成大规模病毒式传播。级联深度通常浅（1-2层），但宽度可以很大</li>\n<li><strong>网络嵌入</strong>：LinkedIn 的研究（2022 Nature 论文）通过大规模随机实验证实：中等强度的弱连接（moderately weak ties）对求职最有效——比最弱的（几乎不认识）和最强的（亲密朋友）都更有效</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"社区检测的实际应用\">社区检测的实际应用</h2><p>在社会网络中识别社区有直接应用价值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>市场营销</strong>：识别兴趣群体，在社区内通过种子用户引爆传播</li>\n<li><strong>欺诈检测</strong>：欺诈者倾向于形成彼此配合的小团体（紧密社区）</li>\n<li><strong>组织诊断</strong>：映射企业内非正式网络，发现信息瓶颈和孤岛</li>\n<li><strong>公共卫生</strong>：识别高风险接触网络社区，定向干预</li>\n</ul>\n<p>社区检测的算法选择应匹配分析目的：模块度优化适合发现密度差异，Infomap 适合捕获信息流模式，重叠社区方法（如 BigCLAM）适合处理一人属多个社交圈的现实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sna-的方法论挑战\">SNA 的方法论挑战</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>边界问题</strong>：社会网络的边界如何定义？包含谁、排除谁直接影响结构度量</li>\n<li><strong>缺失数据</strong>：真实社会网络几乎总是不完整观测——未观测到的边会系统性扭曲中心性和社区结构</li>\n<li><strong>因果推断</strong>：观察到&quot;结构位置 X 与结果 Y 相关&quot;不等于&quot;X 导致 Y&quot;——可能存在共同原因（如能力同时决定了位置和结果）</li>\n<li><strong>隐私与伦理</strong>：社会网络数据的获取和使用涉及深刻的隐私问题——匿名化网络数据被证明可以去匿名化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>社会网络分析将社会结构建模为关系图，关注结构位置如何决定个体的机会与约束。弱连接理论和结构洞理论提供了&quot;为什么网络位置比个人属性更预测成功&quot;的解释框架。简单传播与复杂传播的区分指导了不同干预策略的选择——信息传播靠弱连接和 hub，行为改变靠宽桥和社区内聚。大规模在线平台数据验证了经典理论的同时也暴露了新挑战：因果推断、隐私伦理和缺失数据。对技术人员而言，SNA 工具箱直接适用于社交产品设计、推荐系统优化和网络安全分析。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"biological-networks\">生物网络</a> | <a href=\"technological-networks\">技术网络</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"社会网络分析（Social Network Analysis）","id":"社会网络分析-social-network-analysis"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"社会网络分析的学科定位","id":"社会网络分析的学科定位"},{"level":2,"text":"强连接与弱连接","id":"强连接与弱连接"},{"level":2,"text":"结构洞理论","id":"结构洞理论"},{"level":2,"text":"影响力传播与扩散","id":"影响力传播与扩散"},{"level":2,"text":"在线社交网络的大规模实证","id":"在线社交网络的大规模实证"},{"level":2,"text":"社区检测的实际应用","id":"社区检测的实际应用"},{"level":2,"text":"SNA 的方法论挑战","id":"sna-的方法论挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"幂律与临界性（Power Laws & Criticality）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/complex-systems/power-laws-criticality"},"next":{"title":"生物网络（Biological Networks）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications/biological-networks"}}